Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.33,0:00:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't we just see each other yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That was only in-game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.71,0:00:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we entering the tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.29,0:00:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a mission to carry out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.67,0:00:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.13,0:00:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wish to enter the tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.50,0:00:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.17,0:00:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.29,0:00:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then it's settled. Let's head over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.67,0:00:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Executor missions always \Nhave plenty of support.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.50,0:01:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.96,0:01:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Pan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.16,0:01:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.58,0:01:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.67,0:01:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we need to run a test
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.46,0:01:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,to see if you can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to open your portal from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.80,0:01:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to go as far as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.75,0:01:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.88,0:01:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.17,0:01:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,58 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.54,0:01:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,58.2
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.83,0:01:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.54,0:01:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:01:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.33,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.99,0:01:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.88,0:02:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,56.8 to 58.2.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.63,0:02:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.63,0:02:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You've improved again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember how to control the distance?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.33,0:02:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do 50 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.96,0:02:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.25,0:02:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.79,0:02:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sense my Devour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.46,0:03:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This time is a field test.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll have to enter the spaces I devour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.79,0:03:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll look like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The space won't be much bigger than a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.63,0:03:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need to keep in mind the\Nangle and position of your portals,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.75,0:03:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so we can jump through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay my pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.79,0:03:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's bigger, it's easier to make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.84,0:04:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Test complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.95,0:04:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mission this time is a rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The process is fairly simple,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's no room for mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.42,0:04:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and the mission fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,When the time comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.54,0:04:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll move sixteen kilometers this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.67,0:04:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need to open three hundred in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Three hundred?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I rest in between?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that many.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A power bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Put it on,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and it'll store your spirit energy to use later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I wear it all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.21,0:04:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit energy has to come from your own training.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Go stretch a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.17,0:04:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll head out soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone an Executor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.29,0:05:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Baiyou, the leader of this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.67,0:05:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Wuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.75,0:05:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Baiyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.79,0:05:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xiaohei, thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.75,0:05:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.55,0:05:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,, What kind of cave is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no pathways.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A Breath-Holding Pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep it in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.79,0:05:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no air inside the rock I devour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.75,0:06:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.63,0:06:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,With you here, Master, what's there to be nervous about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.54,0:06:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.25,0:06:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.79,0:06:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you sense my Devour,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,immediately open your portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine if you're a little off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll correct it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have to open one every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.71,0:06:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.26,0:06:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.42,0:06:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep this rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:06:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.96,0:07:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting used to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.42,0:07:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.38,0:07:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.10,0:07:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.88,0:08:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for my signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want to slip up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.79,0:08:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's pick up the pace a little this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be a bit different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sense carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.67,0:08:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.92,0:08:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Six more to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll devour twice in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,On the last one,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,we won't go through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.75,0:09:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch my position.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Be as precise as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we head back,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the same way we came.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We can take our time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.46,0:09:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.46,0:09:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, is this who we came to save?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that a bat cave back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He was trapped in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.79,0:09:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul intact, spirit space seems stable. He's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.75,0:09:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally got to do a mission with you, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.17,0:10:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Without you, this mission would've been ver difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But you could've devoured your way through yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That would do too much damage to the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.79,0:10:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Wuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.42,0:10:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.04,0:10:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.58,0:10:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your hard work!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Great job, Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.38,0:10:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends are still waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.33,0:10:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Go find them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.63,0:10:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.79,0:10:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.38,0:10:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.33,0:11:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard he's going to school in Lingxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.75,0:11:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Guild has its own school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he made friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The folks you said you’d visit in a few days...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're his friends' parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.38,0:11:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I better give them a heads-up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.42,0:11:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise I might scare them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.33,0:11:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t know you were so savvy with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What gift are you bringing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.25,0:11:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to bring a gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you'd show up empty-handed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do I bring?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.21,0:11:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.46,0:11:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never given one either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.50,0:11:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,These are my best friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanxin,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and A-Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.71,0:11:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:11:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just call me Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.71,0:11:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Hall Manager Pan of Longyou Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Hall Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Pan,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Study hard
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.67,0:12:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and keep growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be counting on you all from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei is super smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.08,0:12:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.83,0:12:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai and the others started teaching me to write!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.53,0:12:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.79,0:12:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get your enrollment sorted out soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll find a place and move here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.91,0:12:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be neighbors too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we live at Xiaobai's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely not.
